### VS Code REST Client / JetBrains HTTP Client example
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@id = REPLACE_WITH_PRODUCT_ID

### Create product
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "PEN-001",
  "name": "Blue Ball Pen",
  "category": "Stationery",
  "description": "Blue ink ballpoint pen",
  "quantity": 30,
  "unitPrice": 15.50,
  "lowStockThreshold": 5
}

### List all
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products

### Find by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/{{id}}

### Update a product
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/products/{{id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "PEN-001",
  "name": "Blue Ball Pen - Updated",
  "category": "Stationery",
  "description": "New stock",
  "quantity": 20,
  "unitPrice": 16.00,
  "lowStockThreshold": 5
}

### Add stock
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/products/{{id}}/stock
Content-Type: application/json

{ "change": 10 }

### Take stock out
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/products/{{id}}/stock
Content-Type: application/json

{ "change": -3 }

### Search
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/search?keyword=pen

### Low stock
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/low-stock

### Summary
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/summary

### Export CSV
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/export/csv

### Delete product
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/products/{{id}}
